{"product":{"id":9728668991713,"title":"BILLY GOAT 114","body_html":"<p>The Billy Goat 114 is our resort soft-snow specialist: a 114mm directional powder ski built to float in soft snow, pivot through tight terrain, and hold up in variable conditions.</p>\n<p>The Billy Goat 114 features the Reverse Elliptical Sidecut that defines the series: a large convex arc from boot center to the tip that keeps the ski catch-free in soft snow, paired with a traditional tail radius that still holds an edge on the groomer home. Signature Pow Rocker helps the ski plane early and pivot easily, while low camber underfoot keeps it loose and maneuverable without giving up drive through chop and crust. A directional mount and supportive platform suit skiers who want to steer a powder ski from the front and still trust it when the snow turns. This is the Billy Goat with the most range, built for soft-snow days, tight trees, and the variable weeks between storms.</p>\n<p>Every Billy Goat 114 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, drivable, and durable soft-snow ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:27-07:00","handle":"billy-goat-114","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:58-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Billy Goat, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128508391649,"product_id":9728668991713,"title":"176cm","price":"949.00","sku":"27ON3PBG114176","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"176cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:27-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":6,"old_in